      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قُشَارَةٌ</span></b>  <i>Peel, rind, bark,</i> or <i>the like,</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لِحَآء</span>,) or
<i>skin, pared off,</i> or <i>removed, from a thing;</i> (M,
K;) [<i>parings,</i> or <i>bits,</i> or <i>particles,</i> of a thing,
<i>that fall off,</i> or <i>are pared off.</i>]

